<title>NORWAY: Norway expands t-bill by 3.0 billion crowns.</title>
<headline>Norway expands t-bill by 3.0 billion crowns.</headline>
<dateline>OSLO 1996-11-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Norway's central bank said on Thursday the Finance Ministry was expanding the SS42 treasury bill by three billion crowns.</p>
<p>The amount will be issued at an ordinary auction with final date for tenders at 0900 GMT on Monday. Settlement is two days later.</p>
<p>The bill was issued on March 14 with a nominal interest rate of 4.70 percent. It matures on March 19, 1997.</p>
<p>--Oslo newsroom +47 22 42 50 41</p>
</text>
